  title: 'Recap: clean power and our islands'
  body: 'Geothermal power uses the Earth''s own heat, so it releases very little
    CO2 compared with burning coal. Cutting emissions matters here: the Philippines
    faces stronger typhoons, floods and rising seas as the planet warms.'
